              "exact_quote": "Unsupervised learning involves providing an unlabeled data set to a machine learning program, which then learns to identify patterns and structures in the data without any explicit guidance."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0020",
              "exact_quote": "Clustering is a technique that falls under unsupervised machine learning, where patterns are noticed and items are grouped into buckets based on those patterns."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0021",
              "exact_quote": "Clustering can be used for outlier detection; data points that do not belong to any cluster are marked as outliers."
            },
